cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research software, please cite the archived version when a DOI is available, or cite this repository."
type: software
title: "Cycle-Integral Sensor Certificates (CIFC)"
abstract: >-
  An exploratory research prototype for testing consistency among first-order
  sensors sharing an unknown input, using an integrated pairwise inequality,
  deterministic uncertainty bounds, and graph-based conflict analysis.
  The results are synthetic, have not been independently peer reviewed or
  hardware validated, and are not claimed to establish scientific novelty.
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
authors:
